{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "83f0ae1abab90a82c3081753d3abe9ca796d5bd006e638200b5a4eb6d5b664e9", "ja": "迷い道を照らして", "zh": "照亮迷途", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f91e5ba5eb5479bf021fc9324278deba2d6532fd37ecead5d0fdf23f20a13ce2", "ja": "収録に行ったあずさと可奈は、事故渋滞で歩\nいて帰ることに。帰り道、自分だけ練習が遅\nれていると不安がる可奈を、あずさは元気づ\nける。また、道に迷うあずさを、可奈は歌で\n案内。ふたりは無事に劇場に帰り着いた。", "zh": "梓与可奈在结束录影要回剧场时，\n遇上交通因事故而堵塞，两人便决定走路回去。\n可奈在途中诉说不安，\n认为只有自己的练习落后，梓便为她打气。\n同时，可奈为迷路的梓唱歌带路，\n两人总算平安抵达剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "988905b7f7530d056676cac24cd9f8691d5cafcd4f1b592fe4e529eeacc6e08c", "ja": "（真たちが出演した番組で、またBIRTHの宣伝を\nさせてもらえる事になった。今回出演するのは……）", "zh": "（之前真她们录过的节目，再次给了『BIRTH』\n登场宣传的机会。这次参加的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3cb04ab41399f7cd0429b418341d189ff9c22138d746b381f4cf109d23b8b3a", "ja": "音楽番組に出してもらえるなんて、ビックリです！\nそれも、あずささんと一緒～♪", "zh": "我居然可以参加音乐节目，好惊讶！\n而且还是跟阿梓姊一起参加～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "63de2e802e7b9858e537b5e6f2bf0a2fea5820c7210c01e050f11faa0778cd09", "ja": "前回の真ちゃんと歩ちゃん、とっても評判が\nよかったみたいだし。私たちも頑張らないとね。", "zh": "上次小真跟小步似乎获得非常好的评价，\n我们也要加油才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "471a353e4a10a49ee936ec08f56b44e67de161514f82a0b29ffa52b631eed777", "ja": "それじゃあ、収録が終わる頃に車で迎えに来ます。\nその後はBIRTHのレッスンですから。", "zh": "那等录影结束后，我再开车来接你们，\n然后再去参加『BIRTH』的训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "fb6e1e93ab00980aa7298f8314571f300ca5449ca015d310b38f3b05cd2acebe", "ja": "はーい！　レッスンのために、\n体力残しておきますねっ！", "zh": "好的──！\n我会记得为训练保留体力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "c06e664f708c5829a4c7c301b021550720ee27a90a14f140709aaafa71d1eabf", "ja": "いってきます。{$P$}さんも、\n打ち合わせ頑張ってくださいね。", "zh": "我们走了。\n{$P$}先生开会也请加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1006_null", "source_sha256": "d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c", "ja": "数時間後……", "zh": "几小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f4502ac8b5793f48d747ef2aa82fe48cfa2cfbe48874c2cf279a86ff798eb7d3", "ja": "（お、あずささんから電話だ……。\n予定よりだいぶ早いけど、もう終わったのかな？）", "zh": "（哦，是梓小姐的电话……\n比预定时间还要早很多，是已经结束了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "0b8cd0f334dc7812b1ddce7a241a311bbab915df6960725bf65881b304029c64", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん？\nあの、あずさです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生？\n那个，我是梓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d2192fc027e307a1aad4879f2f007f9473b8edb3d89878f8d3e30609c65a0937", "ja": "あずささん、お疲れさまです。\n収録、もう終わったんですか？", "zh": "梓小姐，辛苦你了。\n录影已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "6be2d120cf7a103b1344766bc683af9b19838c4d5a8d4bd5969c8f5137e62f4b", "ja": "はい、それが……。\n収録自体は、早く終わったんですけれど……。", "zh": "是的，其实……\n录影本身是提早结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "deaf9fa42e02795b15952962992d726465f540634662c0105c6a09da66f0b2d3", "ja": "スタジオの周りの道路が、事故で通行止めになっている\nみたいで、その……車が動かないんです～。", "zh": "但摄影棚周边的道路好像发生交通事故无法通行，\n所以……目前车子全都卡在路上～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ae26388f347a48c229d7849a42569883a8494ae058178852d01b7a76fa351e58", "ja": "えっ！？　困ったな……。歩こうにも、スタジオから\n駅までは、ちょっと距離がありますよね……うーん。", "zh": "咦！？真伤脑筋……即使想用走的，\n记得摄影棚距离车站有点远……唔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "1eb5bb2562fe996091628d2d7ced51a9c646605541cba6b35962da8e9cf9e820", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん！\nそれで私たち、相談したんですけど。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生！\n所以我们两个商量过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "99794d81e2c114bb5d584181d879e5c9b39240972b85487f3f0981872875a6b9", "ja": "駅まで歩いて、そこから電車で帰りますっ。\n{$P$}さんは、待っててください！", "zh": "我们要走到车站，从那里坐电车回去。\n{$P$}先生，请你等我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "27235d647ddd78e82bf46f7946a1a965c0afd152a21b7fd415580c877263e234", "ja": "え！？　で、でも、あずささんが……コホン。\n可奈、大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "什么！？但、但是梓小姐她……咳咳。\n可奈，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "03e33366b678c1164348ccbcd37ab96395c0dca642262bd2e7181fd9773212f3", "ja": "大丈夫です！\nあずささんには、私がついてますから！", "zh": "没问题！\n我会陪在阿梓姊身边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "e0a0b7eea6cad01cfd99e9ac89eea749d1c13707d5e81f35477a216cc02e07ed", "ja": "可奈ちゃんには、私がついてますから。ふふっ。", "zh": "我会陪在可奈身边，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cc65e150bc1e3e0cfaaf22f632320f7849e13f802939f65cc7e0e6a4f8488391", "ja": "そ、そうですか……ふたりだけなのは心配ですけど、\n車が使えない以上、それしかないですね……。", "zh": "是、是吗……让你们两个自己走我有点担心，\n但既然没办法开车载你们，也只能这样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d4010610b44799ccac6843e36e1bc36007db3f7f6f351e575ff44dc9df3cd530", "ja": "それじゃあ……可奈、あずささん、\n気をつけて帰ってきてくださいね！", "zh": "那么……可奈、梓小姐，\n你们回来的路上要多注意安全喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "e12046a52bcc1553124dad2a5db66f306f36dcff24708fe4c770ccc64274e79e", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さんは、\n事務所でゆっくり待っていてくださいね♪", "zh": "好的。那么{$P$}先生，\n请在事务所悠悠哉哉等我们回去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "8edf1bc8d53a022c62cee05855ea63002257a54f565d1a48f96e27f0aad2ea32", "ja": "元気に歩こう～♪　ゴーゴゴー♪\n鳥さん猫さん、ついてこい～♪", "zh": "充满活力向前走～♪GO～GOGO～♪\n小鸟小猫都跟上来～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "d1357e53e008090a9eeb65647d622328fa803940135d0cbca276bd45c73d7689", "ja": "歩いて駅まで行くことになっちゃいましたけど、\nなんだかお散歩みたいで楽しいですね！", "zh": "虽然变成要用走的去车站是个意外，\n但感觉好像在散步，真开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "422a43765e86a1965a4568815a3fe8a6dfa07487389972fd23722f43f00ac932", "ja": "うふふ、そうね。お天気もいいから、\nついつい寄り道しそうになっちゃうけど……。", "zh": "唔呵呵，就是说啊。\n天气也很好，会让人忍不住想绕路……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "65d9f830f6e5488829e837dd83f733fcf53de444f15da16ed20fc0403065605a", "ja": "あっ、そっちじゃありませんよ、あずささん！\nBIRTHのレッスンに遅れちゃいます～っ！", "zh": "啊，不是那边喔，阿梓姊！\n不然会赶不上『BIRTH』的训练唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "4e82797161b34862a57b31c4db5e2e01bc101f396a27a1090485fca494fddb4f", "ja": "進路は～どっち～♪　向こうだ～スイッチ～♪\nあずささんはこっち～♪　こっち、こっちですよー！", "zh": "正确的路～是哪一条路～♪是另一边～快换一条路～♪\n阿梓姊要走这一条路～♪这边，是这边喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "7c8cb257f9ad55ad6cfb7af31247d3e3f9e97b9dabd8e9d5899e07ad8e73464e", "ja": "あら、私ったら……。そうよね、\n寄り道しないで、今日のレッスン頑張らないとね。", "zh": "哎呀，我真是的……说得也是，\n今天不能绕路，要努力训练才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "5da8085476c92f175090b61f7aa858bb28525b9a3cee05e1941cfcd3f5d93051", "ja": "寄り道しないでまっすぐ～、可奈も頑張るレッスン～♪\n……はぁ。あずささんて、やっぱりすごいなー。", "zh": "不要绕路，直接走向目的地～可奈也要努力训练～♪\n……唉，阿梓姊果然很厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "f40722eb11ceffb1ff72d5df47a79ff9190bcbf9fa3067153e646d2675abb26c", "ja": "え？　すごいって……何のこと？", "zh": "咦？很厉害……是在说什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "5ddc9c8c770e482a9e5f6e72cf35f3b14eb282c641c8d52bf9489ea414aeab44", "ja": "だってだって、ダンスは得意じゃないって言ってたのに\nもう振り付け全部覚えちゃったじゃないですか～！", "zh": "因为因为，你明明说不擅长跳舞，\n却已经记住所有舞步了啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a4c069c2484e3b6142cd8dab6cbacf773d3fc9bdf25773156cea1b87088a590", "ja": "雪歩さんだって、ムリかもって言ってたけど、\n真さんと歩さんの前で、ちゃんと踊れたし……。", "zh": "雪步也是，嘴上说自己可能学不会，\n但在真跟步姊面前，还是能跳得很棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "328b98b811b6dad2d196e00e2e282c4e4ceae3cc1ba3eaee819cbd90f75eb35b", "ja": "私、ちゃんとみんなについていけてるのかな～？\n本番も近いのに、可奈だけダメダメだな～。はぁ……。", "zh": "我有好好跟上大家的脚步吗～？\n正式公演都快到了，却只有可奈这么不行不行～唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "9f7b067260c617a9d6ce40ffe1fb9ac84c59921dbf8ab7ba12fb75e152b189cc", "ja": "……可奈ちゃんって、少しだけだけど、\n雪歩ちゃんに似てるのね。", "zh": "……可奈有点像雪步呢，\n虽然只是有一点点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "63fd427ce323407afeeafb643c8d60b1a08c7720bc6bf5d8794e5a183d083772", "ja": "ええ？　私が雪歩さんに、ですか？", "zh": "咦？我有点像雪步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "c21c720d116201e0455ae3fa6bc6931843adc9faa3ccc1c38ebc96209ddfbed3", "ja": "雪歩ちゃんも、事務所に入りたての頃は、よく\n「ダメダメです～」って、泣いたりしてたの。", "zh": "雪步刚进入事务所的时候，\n也经常哭着说自己「不行不行～」喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1035_010azu", "source_sha256": "0747f953fe08b2707047e93e1e1414549b2399ec4f5abad47a5ebef41ca07df0", "ja": "でも今は、そんな自分をちゃんと受け止めて。自分で\n自分を励ましながらステージに立ってるんだと思うわ。", "zh": "但她现在已经接受这样的自己。\n她会一边鼓励自己，一边站上舞台表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1036_010azu", "source_sha256": "2633a193f173ac8144e22979b7048118c8a2e109a1df260a2b87f1462ef692c8", "ja": "そんな風に、今の雪歩ちゃんが頑張れてるのは、\n可奈ちゃんや歩ちゃんがいるからじゃないかしら？", "zh": "现在的雪步能够像这样努力，\n都是因为有可奈跟小步在的关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "0999ae7137fa65afe4b9ef0eb548f0aa37865786c346e63c0a889868f6c12b9c", "ja": "私と歩さんがいるから……？\nあずささん、それってどういうことですか？", "zh": "因为有我跟步姊在……？\n阿梓姊，那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1038_010azu", "source_sha256": "ac8842aa46e59073a21a24116a09e9bae92c094b41a7c76e16e6f2f034c9ce25", "ja": "先輩になったからには、自分も頑張らなくちゃって。\nきっと、そんなふうに張り切ってるんだって思うの。", "zh": "她一定心想「我现在是前辈了，也要努力才行」。\n我想她肯定就是因此才会充满干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "ad51f740cd7f11083dfbe4bfd34c7c35a9fe5b14f82563681374a3b1ab2c9f67", "ja": "可奈ちゃんも、今はBIRTHの末っ子だけど……\n後輩ができたら、気持ちがわかるかもしれないわね。", "zh": "可奈现在虽然是『BIRTH』的老么……\n但等你有了后辈，也许就能明白这种心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "0782e47ca2f8e73440e6263a3fc3b81314dd97ce729423f5559667f63b9b19db", "ja": "ふわっ！？　わわ、私に、後輩……！？\nそんなの、想像もつかないですよーっ！", "zh": "唔哇！？我我、我有后辈……！？\n这种事我根本无法想像～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1041_010azu", "source_sha256": "5393a7bf6c062b080eca05d682a2a3c4d4b1f9fffb9eeed5df126104f26cbcbd", "ja": "うふふ、今はそうよね。私だって、そうだったもの。\n……あ、そうだわ可奈ちゃん。", "zh": "唔呵呵，现在还没办法吧，因为我曾经也是这样。\n……啊，对了，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1042_010azu", "source_sha256": "40062999fef08fac4063c6a35f4276a503f42fd7c5540f177c443d75e7ba4c54", "ja": "実はね……私、時々ダンスの居残りレッスンをして、\n{$P$}さんに見てもらってるの。", "zh": "其实呀……我偶尔会留下来练舞，\n然后请{$P$}先生帮忙看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "2566245c4ee477303cba90826bf6ec929fc9454763374c480508cf01453c8657", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうだったんですか？", "zh": "咦？原、原来有这回事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "5f2a97848ba2fbda37a8f1fe41822ff7c1fb44dcbb9a0f5c141be62edff5b702", "ja": "そうなの。\nよかったら、今度から可奈ちゃんも一緒に練習しない？", "zh": "是呀。有空的话，\n下次可奈要不要也一起练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "baf09c169a8eb10a9adc89f6c2b1e73b58f29c5dd96bd48cd004807c6f3e6509", "ja": "可奈ちゃんも、おいていかれたくないんでしょ？\n真ちゃんや歩ちゃんに。私もそうなのよ。", "zh": "可奈也不想落后其他人吧？\n比如小真或小步，而我也是喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "阿梓姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "3a4a63b930dc586258ee97bedc7c9c9c90a381aa74b79bf25334c9e436b63e74", "ja": "や……やります！　私、居残りレッスンやります！　\nマラソンでも反復横跳びでも、なんでもっ！", "zh": "我……我要加入！我要留下来训练！\n不管是长跑还是反复横跳，我都愿意练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1048_010azu", "source_sha256": "acaf980b123c2a6af5a74f9ba0f657c956baac319d0024a8cbcbfaf20fc374a5", "ja": "よかった。\nそれじゃ、これからは一緒に頑張りましょうね。", "zh": "太好了，\n那以后就一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "ba7a9b437e9b015d356867a32de160f093233a01ea0078153a04e05d34d6bd63", "ja": "はい！　……って、あ、あずささん大変です！\nいつの間にか、知らない場所に来ちゃってますよ～！？", "zh": "好的！……等等，阿、阿梓姊，糟了！\n我们不知不觉来到陌生的地方了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1050_010azu", "source_sha256": "4e63a3b62b9fab9847885551ad9c104e0e3ccd6c4f22c2c6b39cb207dcbe854f", "ja": "あら……？\nえ～っと……ここは、どこかしら～？", "zh": "哎呀……？\n呃……这里是哪里呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "69f0509705f707b10da6579cc615878b4dd9f31ef8ec847792b450d64af71923", "ja": "あずささんと可奈、遅いな。{$P$}、\nふたりは電車で帰ってくるんですよね？", "zh": "阿梓姊跟可奈真慢。\n{$P$}，她们会坐电车回来对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1052_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d24e16357645f1ba35e473b64c6678c9f472f8bf30024bb6d985e8e79fdce3d3", "ja": "それにしては、時間がかかりすぎてる気が……。\nどこかで道に迷っちゃったんでしょうか？", "zh": "就算是这样，感觉也花太多时间了……\n会不会在哪里迷路了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1053_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1bcb2c3ac637cbf82cab5d805cf29998c778b7a364567da3cbf57077c325bf9e", "ja": "マイガーッ！？　可奈もあずさも、\n迷子になっちゃったってこと？　ど、どうしよう！", "zh": "My God！？\n你是说可奈跟梓都迷路了吗？怎、怎么办！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1054_006mak", "source_sha256": "a340d7bc64aea05391174c5eb89291c27aceadd6e066d25879f8a6fcd89001bc", "ja": "とりあえずボク、駅まで迎えに行ってきます！\n心配ですから！", "zh": "总之，在下要去车站接她们！\n在下实在很担心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "eefa3cc7406366007a4f11795ac64347e59a06c040babd12d152dd980647873d", "ja": "真、俺も行くよ。\n迷ってるようなら、人手があった方がいいからな。", "zh": "真，我也一起去。\n如果她们迷路了，人手多一点比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1056_034ayu", "source_sha256": "84fddbf015a41189fb10cb5817a87db4932ac55c48f40f9cc4b4e6e390eab2af", "ja": "待って、真、{$P$}！\nならアタシも……！", "zh": "等等，真、{$P$}！\n那我也要去……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1057_004yuk", "source_sha256": "288373395ba7daca5c14911a6e27759cbc9e3c2c4e63f495a3850db2498597d8", "ja": "わ、私も……。", "zh": "我、我也要去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1058_006mak", "source_sha256": "fb8a7d7b63c6d32a87b4440ca47de94ac9ae2b1b6c7b3eab8a01f473e03ffd28", "ja": "いや、雪歩は残ってて。\n留守番してる人がいないと、事情を説明できないから。", "zh": "不行，雪步你留下来。\n要是没有人留守，就没办法跟别人解释情况了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1059_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f2984e565ba29a97bb09ffd0920f2959dd509a05fda901c602ee90295b4cf477", "ja": "真ちゃん……そ、そうだね。\nそれじゃ、私はここでみんなを……。", "zh": "小真……说、说得也是。\n那我在这里等大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1060_se", "source_sha256": "ab891e62578da72bb10899bd83d3ea003f20decf24b49e30ef768308acd59625", "ja": "カチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1061_036kan", "source_sha256": "d3f0932ce8cb765c838dcffeabae3ed2a32621aafa1387e5417c82389530fcfd", "ja": "じゅ、12時59分～♪　ギリギリセーフ～……♪\nううっ、疲れました～……。", "zh": "1、12点59分～♪勉强赶上……♪\n呜呜，好累啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1062_010azu", "source_sha256": "26c04da60792ef0553a5e2a5f38487f001f37d284e160f424c9464f249b7c712", "ja": "ふう～、予定より少し遅れちゃったけど、\nなんとかレッスンには間に合ったみたいね？", "zh": "呼～虽然比预定的还要晚一点，\n但勉强赶上训练了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1063_006mak", "source_sha256": "fd4e20b72ed10ff5e155199a23377b8fef08ab5f55eed71e08afbac50c11793b", "ja": "あ、あずささん！　可奈！", "zh": "阿、阿梓姊！可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1064_p", "source_sha256": "bd984aac784137082cd22a10d90dcdc625b92636e3d13845470073d117f3bfbc", "ja": "よかった、ふたりとも……。", "zh": "太好了，你们两个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1065_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d2f3d21334274c8dd22d41edb86e128738c3ac7094e92d29e277793344e73c35", "ja": "あんまり遅いから、真ちゃんたちが\n心配して迎えに行こうとしてたところでした……。", "zh": "你们太慢了，所以小真她们很担心，\n正想去接你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1066_010azu", "source_sha256": "3f9e6596270deaaa39b21204fb5f092cbb12860713d07098765cc3c6d188cd2e", "ja": "まぁ、そうだったの？　ごめんなさいね、みんな。\n心配をかけてしまって……。", "zh": "哎呀，是这样啊？对不起呀，大家。\n让你们担心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1067_006mak", "source_sha256": "e92aa25a604f14028e036649bcb37039b9b4e1cff265984ef1ca3c681d0b530b", "ja": "いえ、ふたりとも無事なら、いいんです！\n可奈が道案内してくれたんだよね？　お疲れさま！", "zh": "哪里，只要你们平安无事就好！\n应该是可奈负责带路的吧？辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1068_036kan", "source_sha256": "5289af23de937d61b2e8f95eeaaea04046b85e1eb3d05516d5723f3489292bc8", "ja": "…えっと、それはですね～。", "zh": "……呃，这个嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1069_010azu", "source_sha256": "997cb9f36e0ac1e83693b26da2d6d9ceccc65fa3b08586dfd81168f8740b234c", "ja": "私がひとりで違う道に行きそうになると、\n可奈ちゃんが歌を歌って呼び戻してくれたの。", "zh": "每次我差点要自己走错路时，\n可奈就会唱歌叫我回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1070_010azu", "source_sha256": "2bb01e93e6017f0b94c6c154af35f50c2a2dd91421b5fcee9d929922b577356e", "ja": "だから間に合ったのは、可奈ちゃんのおかげね。\nありがとう、可奈ちゃん。", "zh": "所以能赶上时间，都是托可奈的福。\n谢谢你，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1071_036kan", "source_sha256": "577cdcf47259a3f35308475517a66c7a14df9a867298d9e3d6358225fc7ee0bf", "ja": "えへへっ、歌ならお安い御用です！\nららら～♪　お役立ち～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，只是唱歌再简单不过了！\n啦啦啦～♪帮上忙了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_04_1072_p", "source_sha256": "79b04b0ffb6ad089e2f01e6cf5201d567acf4bc1a846b5ab16a877713faadbe3", "ja": "（みんなが、お互いを思って支え合っている……\nBIRTHも着実に、いいユニットになってるな！）", "zh": "（大家都在为彼此着想，互相支持……\n『BIRTH』正踏实地在逐步成为好团体！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
